rian Jumping"]]] [:script {} "$('#sports_in_same_games_select').change(function(){location.href='/editions/48/sports/'+$('#sports_in_same_games_select').val()})"] [:form {:id "other_games_form", :class "form-inline", :style "display: inline", :method "get"} [:select {:name "year", :id "sport_in_other_games_select", :class "form-control"} [:option {:value ""} "Equestrian Eventing in other Games"] "\n" [:option {:value "6"} "1912 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "7"} "1920 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "8"} "1924 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "9"} "1928 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "10"} "1932 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "11"} "1936 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "12"} "1948 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "13"} "1952 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "15"} "1960 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "16"} "1964 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "17"} "1968 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "18"} "1972 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "19"} "1976 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "20"} "1980 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "21"} "1984 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "22"} "1988 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "23"} "1992 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "24"} "1996 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "25"} "2000 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "26"} "2004 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "53"} "2008 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "54"} "2012 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "59"} "2016 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "61"} "2020 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "63"} "2024 Summer Olympics"]]] [:script {} "$('#sport_in_other_games_select').change(function(){location.href='/editions/' + $('#sport_in_other_games_select').val() + '/sports/EVE'})"] "\n" [:h1 {} "Equestrian Eventing at the 1956 Equestrian Olympics"] "\n" [:table {:class "biodata"} "\n" [:tbody {} [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Dates"] "\n" [:td {} "11 – 14 June 1956"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Medal Events"] "\n" [:td {} "2"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Venues"] "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/venues/403"} "Kapplöpningsbana, Ulriksdal"] " / " [:a {:href "/venues/404"} "Fäboda, Järväfeltets Naturreservat, Sollentuna"] " / " [:a {:href "/venues/233"} "Stockholms Olympiastadion, Stockholm"]] "\n"] "\n"]] "\n" [:div {:class "description"} "\n" [:p {} "Melbourne was selected to host the 1956 Olympic Games but at that time Australia had a strict six-month quarantine rule in place for any animals coming to the island continent. In late 1953, after some negotiation, the Australian government ruled that they would not relax the rules for the Olympics, so the IOC had no choice but to find an alternate site for the equestrian events. Several cities bid for the competitions. At the 48th IOC Session at Athinai on 13 May 1954 the IOC awarded the 1956 Equestrian Events to Stockholm, Sweden, which won the award with a majority of 25 votes. The vote was as follows:"] "\n\n" [:p {} "•\tStockholm, Sweden•\t25•\t•\tParis, France•\t10•\t•\tRio de Janeiro, Brazil•\t8•\t•\tBerlin, Germany•\t2•\t•\tLos Angeles, California, United States•\t2"] "\n\n" [:p {} "On 29 June 1954 the official Organizing Committee was formed, led by HRH Prince Bertil, with the formal name of “The Organizing Committee of the Equestrian Games of the XVIth Olympiad”. The equestrian events were held from 10-17 June 1956, more than five months before the main Olympic Games held in Melbourne’s summer in November-December."] "\n\n" [:p {} "There was an Opening Ceremony in Stockholm, with the equestrian events opened by HRH King Gustaf VI Adolf. There were three final torch bearers within the stadium, all coming in on their horses – " [:a {:href "/athletes/13002"} "Hans Wikne"] ", " [:a {:href "/athletes/29097"} "Karin Lindberg"] ", and Henri Eriksson. The athlete’s oath was spoken by " [:a {:href "/athletes/12678"} "Henri Saint Cyr"] ", who was also on his horse –  and presumably did not say anything. All the nations’ flag bearers carried their flags while riding their horses. As the US team passed the dignitaries’ rostrum, American rider " [:a {:href "/athletes/12787"} "Bill Steinkraus"] " was aboard his horse, " [:em {} [:a {:href "/horses/1761"} "Night Owl"]] ", when the horse was spooked by something and reared back, throwing Steinkraus to the ground. However, he quickly calmed " [:em {} "Night Owl"] " and re-mounted and the ceremony went on without further problems."] "\n\n" [:p {} "Team and individual eventing events were held concurrently over four days at Stockholm. Sweden’s " [:a {:href ""} "Petrus Kastenman"] " won the individual title and Great Britain took the team gold medal."] "\n\n"] "\n\n" [:h2 {} "Events"] "\n" [:table {:class "table table-striped"} "\n" [:thead {} "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Event"] "\n" [:th {} "Status"] "\n" [:th {} "Date"] "\n" [:th {} "Participants"] "\n" [:th {} "NOCs"] "\n"] "\n"] "\n" [:tbody {} [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/185153"} "Individual, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "11 – 14 June 1956"] "\n" [:td {} "56"] "\n" [:td {} "19"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/185158"} "Team, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "11 – 14 June 1956"] "\n" [:td {} "56"] "\n" [:td {} "19"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {}] "\n" [:td {}] "\n" [:td {}] "\n" [:td {:class "border-top"} "\n56 (56/0)\n"] "\n" [:td {:class "border-top"} "\n19 (19/0)\n"] "\n"] "\n"]] "\n\n\n" [:h2 {} "Medals"] "\n" [:table {:class "table table-striped"} "\n" [:thead {} "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Event"] "\n" [:th {:colspan "2"} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] "\n" [:th {:colspan "2"} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] "\n" [:th {:colspan "2"} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] "\n"] "\n"] "\n" [:tbody {} [:tr {} "\n" [:td {:class "top"} [:a {:href "/results/185153"} "Individual, Men"]] "\n" [:td {:style "vertical-align: top"} [:a {:href "/athletes/12209"